        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Édouard Roger-Vasselin, Heather Watson, Julien Benneteau, Nicolas Mahut, Paul Hanley, Jamie Murray\n- Events: 2012 Open Sud de France – Doubles, 2014 Roland Garros men's doubles\n- Topics: tennis, doubles, mixed doubles\n\nFacts:\n- Édouard Roger-Vasselin was born on 28 November 1983 and is a male tennis player from France.\n- Heather Miriam Watson was born on 19 May 1992 and is a British tennis player and a Wimbledon Mixed Doubles Champion.\n- At the 2012 Open Sud de France doubles event, the French pair Nicolas Mahut and Édouard Roger-Vasselin defeated the third-seeded team of Paul Hanley and Jamie Murray in the final 6–4, 7–6.\n- In 2014, Édouard Roger-Vasselin won the Roland Garros men's doubles title with partner Julien Benneteau.",
